    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 19.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gyf he æt ðam ðriddan cyrre nan riht næbbe, ðonne fare he feorðan siðe to scirgemote ⁊ seo scir him sette ðone feorðan andagan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If on the third occasion he does not obtain justice, he shall go on the fourth occasion to the shire court, and the shire court shall appoint a day when he shall issue his summons for the fourth time.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he æt þam þriddan cyrre nan riht næbbe, þonne fare he feorðan siðe to scirgemote, ⁊ seo scir him sette þone feorðan andagan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
